# Corpsejack Menace doubles the +1/+1 counters put on a creature Bot1 controls, and only those: "twice that many +1/+1 counters"
# (CR 614.1a, 122.6). Gev, Scaled Scorch gives Bot1's other creatures an additional +1/+1 counter as they enter while an opponent
# has lost life this turn (Gev's attack makes Bot2 lose 3). Bolted, Kitchen Finks persists: it returns with persist's -1/-1 counter
# and Gev's +1/+1 counter (CR 702.79a, 614.1c), and the Menace makes the +1/+1 counter two but leaves the -1/-1 counter one. One of
# each is then removed as a state-based action (CR 704.5q): Finks is a 4/3 with one +1/+1 counter. (Doubling both kinds would
# leave a 3/2 with none.)

